# A blank line follows each result that prints lines, and none follows a path or
# a repository.
args: search '(repo:example.com/acme/widget foo) or (repo:example.com/acme/widget type:path foo) or (repo:example.com/acme/widget type:commit foo)'
exit: 0
--- stdout
6 files  3 repos  0.7 s
query  (repo:example.com/acme/widget foo) or (repo:example.com/acme/widget type:path foo) or (repo:example.com/acme/widget type:commit foo)

example.com/acme/widget@0123456789ab:a.go
10:x

example.com/acme/widget@0123456789ab:b.go
20:x

